entries.text:
{w=0.7}"I'll repeat what I did. I was the first to leave the attic, and I went to the second floor. I spent several minutes there, during which I heard the elevator once."{w}

"Then, Erina's voice echoed to me, but it was very muddled. All I recognized was "Don't lie! It can only be you. You killed them.""{w}

"I ran down the staircase and found her dead. I didn't see or hear anyone else, so I ran back up to find you all."

