entries.text:
{w=0.4}"Right. He found me first since I was on the third floor. I left the attic later than him and walked through the floors until I stayed on the third."{w}

"I just wanted to be alone for a bit, but I didn't feel like staying put somewhere. However, I ended up spending the most time on the third floor, where I heard the elevator. I spent some time in the offices and some outside."{w}

"Some minutes later, Atsuki came running from below."

