entries.text:
{w=0.4}"I don't think accomplices came into play, because it seems like Erina was killed after she accused someone of being the culprit. However, since you and Atsuki know each other, he could be covering for you."{w}

"Also, if you took the elevator with Erina and Isla, you could've used it to reach the third floor after killing her and sent it back to the crystal floor from there."{w}

"Remember when we sent it from the sixth floor to the crystal floor? We heard no noise. If at that point, Atsuki was already running down the staircase, he might not have heard you. Did you check the elevator when you found Erina?"

