entries.text:
{w=0.4}"Precisely. That's where I was the entire time."{w}

"In the attic, I spent a few minutes in one of the bedrooms with Akaro. Soon, I noticed some people had left, so I checked to see who remained."{w}

"I was a bit angry people were entering and leaving the attic without my consent, so I went to find the people who had left."{w}

"However, I reached the fifth floor and recalled the two dead bodies. Most importantly, that a killer was around. That's what made me stop."{w}

"I had thousands of things to think about, and that's what I did. I went over the incident to see if there was any conclusion I could get to, but ultimately, I didn't move from there. I heard the elevator once, which was the only sound that reached my ears until you guys came."

